  <metadata>
    <title>Keep a child's core-ancestor stamp equal to its intermediate's root: re-stamp the children whenever the intermediate is re-filed (owner round 4 item 5 = option b), and let the upload resolver use the fresh stamp, failing closed on any mismatch</title>
