k corrected with the verifier's finding) and AC8 (live gate) remain open. Verifier round 4 (2026-10-02, branch task/uac-r2-156-r1-r2b): the branch now carries 8531711d6 (work/unified-access-control-r2 at ea6484102 merged), so the project's hard gate (both integration suites in full) is green; the AI update handler's remarks now state the encapsulation property accurately. AC1 (owner; no answer in rounds 1-7 or the #1081 peer report) and AC8 (live gate) remain open.</status-note>
